{'symbol': 'BAX', 'date': '2023-06-20 16:17:00', 'title': 'BAX NEWS: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM INITIATES AN INVESTIGATION INVOLVING POSSIBLE SECURITIES FRAUD VIOLATIONS BY OFFICERS OF BAXTER INTERNATIONAL INC.', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT IT IS INVESTIGATING ALLEGATIONS THAT BAXTER INTERNATIONAL INC. ("BAXTER") (NYSE: BAX) VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. CURRENT INVESTIGATION DETAILS:BAXTER IS A MULTI-NATIONAL HEALTHCARE COMPANY, PRIMARILY FOCUSING ON PRODUCTS DESIGNED TO TREAT KIDNEY DISEASE AND OTHER CHRONIC AND ACUTE MEDICAL CONDITIONS.'}